<title>USA: Identix to increase authorized common stock.</title>
<headline>Identix to increase authorized common stock.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Identix Inc said on Friday its shareholders had approved a plan to increase authorized common stock to 50 million shares from 30 million.</p>
<p>Identix manufactures products for capturing or comparing fingerprints for security, anti-fraud and law enforcement.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
